    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cac:inline-comment-marker ac:ref=\"4b950882-ed7e-45c9-9de0-9607ccfb4efc\"\u003eIn the Liabilities/Receivables Tab in Customer add following columns to the list: POD identifier, Populated place, Combined address (without the populated place). Add the POD identifier and Populated place to the search items - allow only full matches to be filtered. Add the Combined address to the search items - allow partial matches\u003c/ac:inline-comment-marker\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign (Updated): \u003ca href=\"https://xd.adobe.com/view/e1b2bacf-b75f-4a27-9c9a-cea906ab424c-b4e1/screen/720bc341-645e-4278-a9e6-e8557e9bf796/\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\"\u003ehttps://xd.adobe.com/view/e1b2bacf-b75f-4a27-9c9a-cea906ab424c-b4e1/screen/720bc341-645e-4278-a9e6-e8557e9bf796/\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn the liabilities/Receivable listing should be added the next columns:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOD identifier (already added)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\"\u003eIf billing group includes only one pod, this pod should be visible in listing.- for manual liability/Receivable\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor liability which are generated by invoice - If in the invoice third tab one POD exists, display this POD in the listing (when Liability/receivable is generated by invoice) \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElse, if more than one POD exists - display an empty column\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePopulated place\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTake from POD Take from the latest version\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cac:inline-comment-marker ac:ref=\"56b146c5-a00e-4709-b95e-7985ee0d086d\"\u003eCombined address\u003c/ac:inline-comment-marker\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e(This column is already added but with different name \u0026ldquo;POD address\u0026rdquo; we need to change this name)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis combined address should be without populated place.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTake from POD Take from the latest version\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSearch/Filter\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePopulate place\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003enew search/filter value should be added pod address\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt should be filtered by exact match\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn the listing it should be after pod identifier\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOD identifier \u003c/strong\u003e(already added)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e",
                                 "representation":  "storage",
